# Rust / Cargo
/target/
**/target/
**/*.rs.bk
Cargo.lock.bak

# We commit Cargo.lock for the workspace (binary-style project)
# but ignore it for libraries — BHODL ships apps, so keep it.

# Generated UniFFI artifacts (regenerated from .udl)
/bindings/generated/
**/uniffi-generated/

# Kotlin / Gradle / KMP (added when shared/ lands)
.gradle/
build/
**/build/
local.properties
.kotlin/
captures/
*.hprof

# Android
*.apk
*.aab
*.ap_
*.dex
*.class
.idea/
*.iml

# iOS / Xcode
xcuserdata/
*.xcworkspace/xcuserdata/
DerivedData/
*.xcuserstate
Pods/
.swiftpm/

# macOS
.DS_Store

# Windows
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# Editors
.vscode/
*.swp
*~
.zed/

# Secrets — never commit
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.jks
*.keystore
*.age
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Wallet data — never commit (the app keeps it under ~/.bhodl, but a
# test run, a debug copy or a misconfigured data dir can drop it in the
# tree). SQLCipher DBs + sidecars, KDF descriptors / markers, corrupt
# settings snapshots.
*.sqlite
*.sqlite-*
*.db
wallet.kdf.json*
*.kdf.sealed
settings.json.corrupt-*

# mdBook output
/docs/book/

# Logs and crash reports (filesystem, not in repo)
*.log
crash.log

# Local AI / dev tooling — never committed. Assistant configs, agent
# definitions, MCP servers, KB caches and analytics are per-developer and
# may carry machine paths or secrets. This list wins over the managed
# block below.
.claude/
.kimi-code/
.agents/
.mcp.json
.mcp-servers/
.kimi-code/
.dev-suite*
.dev-suite/
.dev-suite-analytics/
.kb-cache/
AGENTS.md
CLAUDE.md

# Raw, unreviewed screenshots (curated ones live in docs/screenshots/)
/screenshots/

# --- dev-suite (managed) ---
# Generated by dev-suite. Local, machine-specific or regenerable only.
# DO commit: AGENTS.md, .dev-suite.json, .dev-suite-manifest.json, the .claude/
# substrate, and every assistant config file not listed below.
.dev-suite-backup-*/
.dev-suite-backup/
.dev-suite-analytics/
.dev-suite-live.json
.claude/.ds-api-touched
.perf-profiler/runs/
# --- end dev-suite ---
